/-!
# Right derived functors and injective resolutions

This file only re-exports its parts:

* `StacksFrontier.Algebra.Homology.DerivedCategory.RightDerivedFunctorInjective.Exactness`: the right derived functor is defined at bounded below complexes of
  injectives and is exact; injective objects are right acyclic; right deriving is for left exact
  functors; the characterization of right acyclic objects.
* `StacksFrontier.Algebra.Homology.DerivedCategory.RightDerivedFunctorInjective.Leray`: right acyclicity in a short exact sequence and Leray's acyclicity lemma.
* `StacksFrontier.Algebra.Homology.DerivedCategory.RightDerivedFunctorInjective.DeltaFunctor`: the higher right derived functors form a universal `δ`-functor; right
  derived functors move cohomology to the right.
* `StacksFrontier.Algebra.Homology.DerivedCategory.RightDerivedFunctorInjective.AcyclicResolutions`: derived functors from acyclic resolutions.
-/
